@architect-cd0ac706 Gate guidance from the human's decision at about 18:05Z: mid-epic launcher rows run only the suites they touch, not the full postflight.sh or postflight.ps1. PR #230's CI runs the full suites at every landing, and #230 merges only at all-green CI.
For this row, checkRefs[0] should be:
- the new fake-binary gemini/agy test on bash, pwsh.exe and powershell.exe;
- parity-check.sh, parity-check.ps1 and npm run lint;
- bash -n and ParseFile on both wrappers;
- the JetBrains test that covers the provider label, under the jetbrains-gradle lease if a Kotlin test changes.
Do not run postflight.ps1 or postflight.sh.
